\n\
If I cast Quantum Riddler, I can draw three cards, or give my team +3/+0 for attack. I have three creatures: two Duelists (2/3 each) and Fear of Missing Out (2/3). That's 9 extra damage.\n\
\n\
But opponent is at 8 life. If I give +3/+0, Duelists become 5/3 each, Fear becomes 5/3. That's 15 power total. They have two Stormchaser's Talents and maybe a Toph, Hardheaded Teacher (3/4). They could block with Toph (3/4) to kill one of my creatures. But I have flying Duelists; Toph doesn't have flying. So I can attack with flying Duelists and Fear (ground). That's 5+5+5=15 damage in the air? Wait Fear is ground (no flying). But Fear can attack and trigger delirium maybe.\n\
\n\
Better to draw three cards to refill hand. I have only one card in hand besides Quantum Riddler and Stormchaser's Talent. Drawing three is huge.\n\
\n\
I'll cast Quantum Riddler, choose draw three.\n\
